WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.830
Hello everyone, and welcome to the workshop.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:07.430
Today I am darning a hole in an old jumper.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.260
I start by weaving across the hole, like this.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.230
Then I go up and down through those threads.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.320
Send us your questions and I will answer them as we go.
